              "fill": "$secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 900,
              "content": "Built on glass. Translucent, blurred surfaces sit over photography, so the interface carries depth without inventing colour of its own. The UI palette is deliberately quiet — soft whites, almost-black type, beige and grey for secondary marks. Brightness enters through imagery, which lets the mood move with the seasons while the interface stays where it is.",
