                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 820,
                  "content": "The interface palette is deliberately quiet: soft whites for glass and buttons, almost-black for type, beige and grey for badges and secondary labels. Saturated colour is not a UI decision — it arrives through photography, so the mood can move with the seasons while the interface stays put. Colour is never the only signal.",
