              "fill": "$secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 900,
              "content": "Cards hold the protocol; forms collect the intake. On paper they lean on white and hairline separation rather than borders and shadow stacks. Over photography the same components move onto glass, and the hairline becomes white at 25% instead of grey.",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 17,
