                  "id": "wimSl",
                  "name": "Desc",
                  "fill": "$secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 900,
                  "content": "Every row across the app renders through the universal black-headline card: a plain-language headline always leads, with a one-line why beneath. Depth is on demand. Repeated cards stay white. The one focus surface per screen is no longer a tint — it is photography behind glass, per Sheet 1. Shown at 384pt, the content width of a 440pt screen at the 28pt inset.",
