                              "name": "Name",
                              "fill": "$ink",
                              "content": "Floating tab bar  ·  component master",
                              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                              "fontSize": 13,
                              "fontWeight": "600"
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "w8YBq",
                              "name": "Spec",
                              "fill": "$secondary",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "24pt side inset, 72pt height, 32pt radius, safe-area offset, contact ring, restrained ambient shadow. Locked 4-tab IA: Today · Discover · Ask · You. One Haze capsule wraps the whole active tab — icon and label together — and travels between tabs rather than fading out and back in. It sits behind the controls, is outside the accessibility tree, and animates with transform only. The fill is the Tab Bar tier at 38% white over a native blur; because Omea's pages are mostly white paper, the bar also carries a 1px edge and a shadow so it keeps a body where the tier alone would vanish.",
                              "lineHeight": 1.45,
                              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                              "fontSize": 13,
                              "fontWeight": "normal"
                            }
                          ]
