                  "name": "Desc",
                  "fill": "$secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 820,
                  "content": "One hue, four forms, and a rule that the form follows the range rather than the reader's taste. The data is the only colour in this product, so charts carry the whole navy ramp and nothing else borrows from it. Note the parent kit's own reject list still applies: no chart may be the focus surface, and none may sit on glass.",
