                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Xjv6Y",
                  "name": "Desc",
                  "fill": "$secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 820,
                  "content": "The scoping screen is the product. Nothing is pre-selected, because the work of the interface is choosing what to include — a pre-ticked form would make sharing everything the path of least resistance, which is the behaviour this product exists to replace. Selection follows Sheet 2 exactly: an Ink outline, plus a checkmark, plus a weight change. Every group also opens, so a share can be one blood panel rather than four, or eleven weeks of nights rather than two years. Identity is a seventh row that cannot be ticked.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                  "fontSize": 15,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
