                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "Dates offer presets and an explicit From and To. Presets are shortcuts, not the whole control — people think in 'since I changed the dose', not 'last three months', and a lab result belongs to a day.",
