                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 820,
                  "content": "Setting up the connector is the only place this product asks somebody to leave the page and do something in another application. It is also the only place a non-technical user can get properly stuck, and the stuck ones do not write in — they close the tab. These rules exist so instructions are written for the person who has never installed anything, without patronising the person who has.",
