                  "fill": "$ink",
                  "content": "Words we use",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                  "fontSize": 28,
                  "fontWeight": "600",
                  "letterSpacing": -0.5
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "U9Xi6",
                  "name": "Desc",
                  "fill": "$secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 820,
                  "content": "The security story is the product, and the fastest way to lose it is to explain it. Nobody outside this room wants to know about keys, ciphertext or postage batches — they want to know who can see their blood panel and until when. Every user-facing string names the consequence; the mechanism stays in the code and in the right-hand column of these sheets. This table is not a tone preference, it is the interface.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                  "fontSize": 15,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "rectangle",
                  "id": "pV4Jn",
